models/
*.onnx
*.onnx.data

# Experiment output. Regenerate with run_all.py, scripts/profile_variants.py, and
# scripts/run_load_sweep.py. Figures committed for the docs live in docs/img/.
#
# The six files below are the exception, and they are committed on purpose: they are the
# inputs every figure in docs/img/ is drawn from. Without them a checkout can run the
# tests but cannot redraw a single figure or check a single number in the docs against
# the data behind it, which makes the measured claims unverifiable by anyone but the
# author. They are 196 KB in total. Everything else here -- the A/B arm directories, the
# per-request CSVs, the inference cache -- stays ignored, because it is either large or
# scratch.
results/*
!results/batch_profiles.json
!results/decode_profiles.json
!results/decode_sweep.json
!results/decoder_profiles.json
!results/load_sweep.csv
!results/session_sharing.json
!results/ab_session_sharing.json
!results/variant_profiles.json
!results/encoder_batching.json
!results/encoder_batching_timed.json
!results/decoder_profiles_tinyllama.json

